# Ported to tests/python-stories/low-level-syntax/ (#433): BalloonChart,
# IcicleChart, NestedMosaicChart, NestedWaffleChart, SankeyTree,
# StringlineChart, Whisker — all byte-identical to the JS baseline. The ports
